                  "heading": "Important Notes"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Web check-in may not be available for:",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Passengers needing special assistance (medical, minors traveling alone, etc.)",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Certain international flights due to security regulations",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Valid photo identification is mandatory at the airport, along with your boarding pass.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "If you have upgraded or changed your booking after check-in, re-issue your boarding pass.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
